+- the survey of a Switch 2 game says `SDK: ?` and `no SDK version string found`, and its provisional profile has `app_pool 0xCD500000`. → [A provisional profile of a Switch 2 game shows no SDK and a Switch 1 memory pool](../reference/packing.md#a-provisional-profile-of-a-switch-2-game-shows-no-sdk-and-a-switch-1-memory-pool)
