+- a provisional profile's heap check reports "the heap request did not fit; set mem_alias", and every later boot aborts in `nninitStartup` (an `nn::diag` abort) after `[mem] SetHeapSize 0x… + modules 0x… > app pool 0x…`; the NSP script's GLSLC capture then finds no shaders and stops with "captured only 0 run-time shaders". → [The heap check stopped before the app pool check](../reference/memory.md#the-heap-check-stopped-before-the-app-pool-check)
