+- outdoor battle ground and lower foliage are nearly black while the characters and the UI stay lit: a baked shadowmask takes the sunlight away. RGBA4 textures sample with their four channels reversed. → [RGBA4 textures in Metal's channel order](../reference/rendering.md#rgba4-textures-in-metals-channel-order)
