+- `[RED] failed to create compute pipeline: Threadgroup memory size (49152) exceeds the maximum threadgroup memory allowed (32768)`, thousands a run; the dispatch is skipped. Once moved to device memory: with more than 512 workgroups in a dispatch, or an indirect one, workgroups found other workgroups' data in their shared memory (no game seen doing so). → [Compute shared memory past 32 KB](../reference/shaders.md#compute-shared-memory-past-32-kb)
+- `[RED] shader <key>_b reflection conversion failed: fetch call 0: frag_pos uniform reference out of range`; the shader does not load and its draws are skipped. → [Uniform references past the first kilobyte](../reference/shaders.md#uniform-references-past-the-first-kilobyte)
+- the GPU hangs (`kIOGPUCommandBufferCallbackErrorHang`) from the first 3D scene on, or frames of about 88 ms, in a shader with a half-float loop. → [HADD2 and HMUL2 with an immediate](../reference/shaders.md#hadd2-and-hmul2-with-an-immediate)
